      "message": "test(xtask): pin the targeted-tests-at-review law\n\nPin the two xtask policy tests on the new law of #3556.\n\nrunner_review_requires_heavy_lanes_without_author_results:\n- asserts that a review runs no full heavy lane;\n- asserts the one targeted heavy step of a P1 PR under the safety floor;\n- asserts that \"not run\" is never a pass for a required step;\n- fails if the old full-lane demand returns.\n\nan_owed_heavy_result_is_allowed_for_p3_and_lower_only:\n- keeps the test name, but pins that the owed-heavy rule is retired in\n  PR-reviewer.md, AGENTS.md and the merge-ready skill;\n- fails if the old P3 deferral or the owed refusal returns.\n\nBoth tests keep their #[test] count: 11 in the module before and after.\nThe light_tests pin still holds and stays green.\n\nRefs #3556\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
