      "message": "docs(process): correct the light-lane and runner lines\n\n- AGENTS.md: the light-lane rule says the full heavy steps of the red\n  twins run at the cut, in the cut gate. It drops the local rerun clause.\n- AGENTS.md, the gate, merge-ready, review-prs and work-issue skills, and\n  PR-reviewer.md name the cut gate and the cut runner, not the post-merge\n  runner. post-merge.yml runs only the batch tier.\n- The decision file records the light-lane rule and the cut-gate wording,\n  and names the maintainer's post-merge words.\n- The xtask pin is renamed to\n  review_requires_targeted_heavy_tests_on_both_paths and pins the runner\n  routing into step 5. The 3460 decision cites the new name.\n\nRefs #3556\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
